## 12. Pricing explanations and commercial conditions

Add a professional section titled:

**Understanding Our Pricing**

Include the following explanations:

**Starting prices:** Published prices represent starting rates for defined standard scopes. Complex or customised projects require a tailored quotation.

**One-time services:** Website builds, setup, design, integration, audits and installation services generally carry a one-time project fee.

**Recurring services:** Maintenance, hosting management, SEO management, IT support and AI management may involve monthly subscriptions.

**Third-party costs:** Domains, hosting infrastructure, paid software, licences, APIs, messaging charges, voice usage and advertising budgets are additional unless specifically included.

**Hardware and equipment:** CCTV equipment, networking hardware and other physical products must be quoted according to project requirements.

**Scope changes:** Work outside the approved quotation or package must receive customer approval and may attract additional fees.

**Support limits:** Monthly plans have defined scope, included allowances and response targets.

**Taxes:** Applicable local taxes or VAT are additional where required.

**Custom projects:** Contact Botlytices for bespoke requirements.

Do not promise guaranteed delivery dates, rankings, unlimited support or results without an expressly defined and commercially approved commitment.

